      "title": "Lab6 的目标与最小用户态范围",
      "content": "Lab6 在协作式任务基础上加入一个内置用户程序，通过 write、yield、exit 三类教学系统调用观察 U-mode 与 S-mode 的边界。学习重点是 sepc、用户栈、sstatus.SPP/SPIE、syscall 寄存器约定和 ecall 返回路径。本实验不是完整 ELF 加载器、多进程用户环境或完备用户指针校验。"
    },
    {
      "id": "lab6-user-context",
      "lab": "lab6",
      "stage": 1,
      "type": "concept",
      "topic": "user",
      "concepts": ["UserContext", "sepc", "sstatus", "SPP", "SPIE", "stack alignment"],
      "files": ["kernel/src/user.rs"],
      "symptoms": ["Lab6-T1-missing", "wrong-privilege", "sepc-zero", "stack-misaligned"],
      "hintLevel": 2,
      "source": "docs/labs/lab6/TASKS.md; docs/labs/lab6/HINTS.md; origin/lab6-starter:kernel/src/user.rs",
      "keywords": ["UserContext", "sepc", "SPP清零", "SPIE设置", "用户栈对齐"],
      "title": "进入 U-mode 前必须准备的 UserContext",
      "content": "UserContext 描述用户入口、对齐后的用户栈顶以及 sret 所需的特权状态。sepc 应表达用户程序入口；用户栈顶要向下满足 16 字节对齐；SPP 必须表示返回 U-mode，SPIE 表达返回后的中断使能状态。Stage 1 只验证这个上下文边界，不证明页面映射、trap 现场和真实 ecall 已经完成。"
    },
    {
      "id": "lab6-sret-privilege-flow",
      "lab": "lab6",
      "stage": 1,
      "type": "flow",
      "topic": "privilege",
      "concepts": ["S-mode", "U-mode", "sret", "sepc", "SPP", "user entry"],
      "files": ["kernel/src/user.rs", "kernel/src/trap.rs"],
      "symptoms": ["still-in-supervisor", "wrong-entry", "immediate-trap", "sret-failure"],
      "hintLevel": 2,
      "source": "docs/labs/lab6/TASKS.md; docs/labs/lab6/HINTS.md",
      "keywords": ["sret如何进入用户态", "sepc与ra区别", "SPP", "特权级返回", "用户入口"],
      "title": "sret 如何从内核进入用户程序",
      "content": "普通函数 ret 依据 ra 返回，而 sret 依据 sepc 和 sstatus 恢复受监督的执行状态。内核先准备入口、栈和特权位，再执行 sret；CPU 根据 SPP 选择返回到 U-mode 还是 S-mode。SPP 配错会停留在错误特权级，入口或页面权限错误则可能在进入后立即产生异常。"
    },
    {
      "id": "lab6-user-memory-boundary",
      "lab": "lab6",
      "stage": 3,
      "type": "concept",
      "topic": "user",
      "concepts": ["user text", "user stack", "PTE U", "execute permission", "write permission", "page fault"],
      "files": ["kernel/src/user.rs", "kernel/src/memory/page_table.rs", "kernel/src/trap.rs"],
      "symptoms": ["instruction-page-fault", "load-page-fault", "store-page-fault", "sret-then-crash"],
      "hintLevel": 2,
      "source": "docs/labs/lab6/TASKS.md; docs/labs/lab6/TESTING.md",
      "keywords": ["用户页U权限", "用户代码页", "用户栈映射", "sret后页错误", "U RX RW"],
      "title": "用户代码页和用户栈的权限边界",
      "content": "正确的 sepc 与 sstatus 只说明返回上下文合理，不代表 U-mode 能访问目标页面。用户代码范围需要用户可访问并具备执行权限，用户栈需要用户可访问并具备读写权限。sret 后立即出现 instruction、load 或 store page fault 时，应结合真实 scause、sepc、stval 核对入口页、栈页和权限，而不是先修改 syscall 分发。"
    },
    {
      "id": "lab6-syscall-abi",
      "lab": "lab6",
      "stage": 2,
      "type": "concept",
      "topic": "syscall",
      "concepts": ["SyscallRequest", "a7", "a0..a5", "a0 return", "register ABI"],
      "files": ["kernel/src/syscall.rs", "kernel/src/trap.rs"],
      "symptoms": ["wrong-syscall-id", "wrong-arguments", "wrong-return-register", "request-decode"],
      "hintLevel": 2,
      "source": "docs/labs/lab6/TASKS.md; docs/labs/lab6/HINTS.md; origin/lab6-starter:kernel/src/syscall.rs",
      "keywords": ["syscall id在a7", "a0到a5参数", "返回值a0", "系统调用ABI", "SyscallRequest"],
      "title": "Lab6 系统调用的寄存器约定",
      "content": "用户程序把 syscall id 放在 a7，最多六个参数放在 a0..a5，内核把这些寄存器解码为 SyscallRequest。系统调用完成后的返回值通常写回 a0，使用户代码在恢复后读取结果。把 a0 误当成 syscall id 会让第一个参数和编号混淆；只在纯 dispatch 中构造正确请求，也不代表 trap 路径已经保存和恢复这些寄存器。"
    },
    {
      "id": "lab6-syscall-dispatch",
      "lab": "lab6",
      "stage": 2,
      "type": "concept",
      "topic": "syscall",
      "concepts": ["SYS_WRITE", "SYS_YIELD", "SYS_EXIT", "dispatch", "UnknownSyscall"],
      "files": ["kernel/src/syscall.rs"],
      "symptoms": ["Unimplemented", "UnknownSyscall", "Lab6-T2-missing", "wrong-result"],
      "hintLevel": 3,
      "source": "docs/labs/lab6/TASKS.md; docs/labs/lab6/HINTS.md; origin/lab6-starter:kernel/src/syscall.rs",
      "keywords": ["dispatch", "write yield exit", "UnknownSyscall", "write返回长度", "exit退出码"],
      "title": "write、yield、exit 的最小分发语义",
      "content": "dispatch 负责把编号和参数转换成内核可理解的结果。write 的教学结果与第三个参数表示的长度相关，yield 不需要额外参数，exit 使用第一个参数表示退出码；未知编号仍应返回 UnknownSyscall。不能用一个无条件成功分支吞掉未知请求，也不能仅通过打印 marker 假装完成分发。这里不提供可直接复制的匹配实现。"
    },
    {
      "id": "lab6-user-ecall-flow",
      "lab": "lab6",
      "stage": 3,
      "type": "flow",
      "topic": "syscall",
      "concepts": ["ecall from U-mode", "trap handler", "SyscallRequest", "dispatch", "sret"],
      "files": ["kernel/src/user.rs", "kernel/src/trap.rs", "kernel/src/syscall.rs"],
      "symptoms": ["ecall-unhandled", "unexpected-cause", "no-user-output", "no-syscall-marker"],
      "hintLevel": 3,
      "source": "docs/labs/lab6/TASKS.md; docs/labs/lab6/HINTS.md",
      "keywords": ["ecall完整流程", "U-mode ecall", "trap分发syscall", "用户态返回", "a7读取"],
      "title": "用户 ecall 到内核处理的完整链",
      "content": "用户入口先设置 a7 和 a0..a5，再执行 ecall。trap handler 应确认异常来自 U-mode，读取保存的寄存器构造请求，调用 dispatch，把结果写回用户可恢复的现场，并推进 sepc。write 或 yield 完成后可以返回用户态，exit 则结束当前教学程序。每一步都应由真实运行 marker 或 trap 事件验证，不能从 Stage 2 的纯函数结果推断整条链已运行。"
    },
    {
      "id": "lab6-sepc-after-ecall",
      "lab": "lab6",
      "stage": 3,
      "type": "concept",
      "topic": "trap",
      "concepts": ["sepc", "ecall instruction", "instruction advance", "repeated trap"],
      "files": ["kernel/src/trap.rs"],
      "symptoms": ["repeated-ecall", "duplicate-output", "qemu-timeout", "exit-never-reached"],
      "hintLevel": 2,
      "source": "docs/labs/lab6/TASKS.md; docs/labs/lab6/HINTS.md; docs/labs/lab6/TESTING.md",
      "keywords": ["ecall后sepc加4", "重复系统调用", "日志一直重复", "返回同一条ecall", "Lab6超时"],
      "title": "处理 ecall 后为什么必须推进 sepc",
      "content": "trap 发生时 sepc 指向触发异常的 ecall。如果返回前不越过该指令，sret 后用户程序会再次执行同一 ecall，形成重复陷入，常见表现是相同 syscall 日志反复出现、exit 永远不到达或 QEMU 超时。更新必须作用于最终恢复路径实际使用的 sepc，而不只是一个随后被丢弃的局部值。"
    },
    {
      "id": "lab6-trap-register-state",
      "lab": "lab6",
      "stage": 3,
      "type": "concept",
      "topic": "trap",
      "concepts": ["saved register state", "a0..a7", "syscall return", "user resume"],
      "files": ["kernel/src/trap.rs", "kernel/src/syscall.rs"],
      "symptoms": ["arguments-lost", "return-value-lost", "corrupted-user-state", "handler-cannot-read-a7"],
      "hintLevel": 3,
      "source": "docs/labs/lab6/TASKS.md; docs/labs/lab6/HINTS.md; origin/lab6-starter:kernel/src/trap.rs",
      "keywords": ["trap保存寄存器", "读取a7", "写回a0", "用户现场", "syscall返回值丢失"],
      "title": "真实 syscall 要求 trap 路径可读写用户寄存器现场",
      "content": "只把 scause、sepc、stval 交给 Rust handler 足以处理早期固定异常，却不足以完成用户 syscall，因为内核还要读取 a7 和 a0..a5，并把返回值保存到恢复后可见的 a0。设计检查应关注汇编保存位置、Rust 可访问表示和恢复路径是否一致。知识块只指出所需能力，不给完整现场结构或汇编模板。"
    },
